{"id":"79fa176fda942663","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/633_有限迹线性时序逻辑_LTLf.md","title":"633 有限迹线性时序逻辑 LTLf","display":"633_有限迹线性时序逻辑_LTLf","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{last},\\operatorname{wnext},\\operatorname{snext},\\operatorname{until}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{last},\\operatorname{wnext},\\operatorname{snext},\\operatorname{until}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{last},\\quad X_wA,\\quad X_sA,\\quad A\\,U_f\\,B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{last},\\quad X_wA,\\quad X_sA,\\quad A\\,U_f\\,B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nF_fA=\\top\\,U_f\\,A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nF_fA=\\top\\,U_f\\,A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{last}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\mathsf{last}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_wA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(X_wA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_sA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(X_sA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U_f\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\,U_f\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\mathsf{last})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\mathsf{last})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(X_wA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(X_wA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(X_sA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(X_sA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A\\,U_f\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A\\,U_f\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{633}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{633}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{633}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{633}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{633}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{633}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{633}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{633}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{633}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{633}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{633}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\mathsf{last})=\\mathsf{last},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\mathsf{last})=\\mathsf{last},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(X_wA)=X_w\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(X_sA)=X_s\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(X_wA)=X_w\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(X_sA)=X_s\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A\\,U_f\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A)\\,U_f\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A\\,U_f\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(A)\\,U_f\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{633}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,633}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,633}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题三族与有限迹公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{WeakNext}^{633}=\\{X_wA\\leftrightarrow(\\mathsf{last}\\lor X_sA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{WeakNext}^{633}=\\{X_wA\\leftrightarrow(\\mathsf{last}\\lor X_sA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StrictLast}^{633}=\\{\\mathsf{last}\\to\\neg X_sA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StrictLast}^{633}=\\{\\mathsf{last}\\to\\neg X_sA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UfFix}^{633}=\\{(A\\,U_f\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_s(A\\,U_f\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UfFix}^{633}=\\{(A\\,U_f\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_s(A\\,U_f\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{633}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{633}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{633}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{633}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{633}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{633}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{633}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{WeakNext}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StrictLast}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UfFix}^{633}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{633}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{WeakNext}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StrictLast}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UfFix}^{633}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{633}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{633}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecSw}^{633}=\\{((A),X_wA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecSw}^{633}=\\{((A),X_wA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndUf}^{633}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_sC))),C\\to(A\\,U_f\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndUf}^{633}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_sC))),C\\to(A\\,U_f\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{633}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecSw}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndUf}^{633}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{633}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecSw}^{633}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndUf}^{633}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>证明行的类型化载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{633}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{633})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{633}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{633})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明对象函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{633})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n\\mathsf{Line}_{633}^{\\,m}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{633})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n\\mathsf{Line}_{633}^{\\,m}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{633}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{633}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=X_wA_j\">\\(A_i=X_wA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_sC))\">\\(A_j=C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land\\neg\\mathsf{last}\\land X_sC))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=C\\to(A\\,U_f\\,B)\">\\(A_i=C\\to(A\\,U_f\\,B)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{633}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{633}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{633}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{633}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{633}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{633}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{633}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标差异是有限迹常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{last}\">\\(\\mathsf{last}\\)</span> 以及弱下一步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_w\">\\(X_w\\)</span> 与强下一步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_s\">\\(X_s\\)</span> 的分离；无限迹 LTL 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{last}\">\\(\\mathsf{last}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-有限迹结构\">10. 有限迹结构</h1>\n<p>定义有限迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\n=\n\\{(n,\\nu):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0,\\ \\nu:n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\n=\n\\{(n,\\nu):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0,\\ \\nu:n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(n,\\nu)\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\">\\(\\rho=(n,\\nu)\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\\)</span>，位置集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限后继关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni,j\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\wedge j=i+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni,j\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\wedge j=i+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义端点谓词与强/弱下一步解释域：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\wedge i+1=n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\wedge i+1=n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NextW}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\ \\text{或}\\ \\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NextW}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j)\\ \\text{或}\\ \\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(n,\\nu)\">\\(\\rho=(n,\\nu)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_s\">\\(X_s\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}\">\\(\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}\\)</span> 有后继时要求子公式成立，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_w\">\\(X_w\\)</span> 在端点由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{633}\">\\(\\operatorname{Last}_{633}\\)</span> 真化。</p>\n<p>有限迹边界许可完全由下列类型化关系给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\n\\bigl(\\{\\mathsf{last},\\mathsf{weak}\\}\\cup(\\{\\mathsf{strict},\\mathsf{weak}\\}\\times\\mathbb N)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\n\\bigl(\\{\\mathsf{last},\\mathsf{weak}\\}\\cup(\\{\\mathsf{strict},\\mathsf{weak}\\}\\times\\mathbb N)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho,i,\\mathsf{last})\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho,i,\\mathsf{last})\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho,i,(\\mathsf{strict},j))\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho,i,(\\mathsf{strict},j))\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NextS}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho,i,(\\mathsf{weak},j))\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho,i,(\\mathsf{weak},j))\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{633}(\\rho,i,j),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho,i,\\mathsf{weak})\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho,i,\\mathsf{weak})\\in\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Last}_{633}(\\rho,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此端点没有 strict-next 许可，且恰有 last 与无后继 weak-next 两种许可。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{633}\\subseteq\n\\{(\\rho,i,A):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633},\\ i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho),\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{633}\\subseteq\n\\{(\\rho,i,A):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633},\\ i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho),\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(n,\\nu)\">\\(\\rho=(n,\\nu)\\)</span>，则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\mathsf{last}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\mathsf{last}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\not\\Vdash_{633}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}X_sA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1&lt;n\\ \\text{且}\\ \\rho,i+1\\Vdash_{633}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}X_sA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1&lt;n\\ \\text{且}\\ \\rho,i+1\\Vdash_{633}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}X_wA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1=n\\ \\text{或}\\ \\rho,i+1\\Vdash_{633}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}X_wA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni+1=n\\ \\text{或}\\ \\rho,i+1\\Vdash_{633}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A\\,U_f\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\,\n\\bigl(i\\le j\\wedge\\rho,j\\Vdash_{633}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)(i\\le h&lt;j\\to\\rho,h\\Vdash_{633}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A\\,U_f\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\,\n\\bigl(i\\le j\\wedge\\rho,j\\Vdash_{633}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)(i\\le h&lt;j\\to\\rho,h\\Vdash_{633}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{633}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{633}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\">\\(i\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_{633}(\\rho)\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\rho,i\\Vdash_{633}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{633}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}:\\varnothing\\models_{633}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{633}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{633}:\\varnothing\\models_{633}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LTLf}_{633}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{633},\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{633},\\widehat\\sigma_{633},\\equiv_{\\alpha,633},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{633},\\mathsf{Rule}_{633},\\mathsf{Line}_{633},\\mathsf{Proof}_{633},\\vdash_{633},\\mathsf{Thm}_{633}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LTLf}_{633}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{633},\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{633},\\widehat\\sigma_{633},\\equiv_{\\alpha,633},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{633},\\mathsf{Rule}_{633},\\mathsf{Line}_{633},\\mathsf{Proof}_{633},\\vdash_{633},\\mathsf{Thm}_{633}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LTLf}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{633}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{633},\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{633},\\widehat\\sigma_{633},\\equiv_{\\alpha,633},\n\\mathsf{FTrace}_{633},\\operatorname{Pos}_{633},\\operatorname{Succ}_{633},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{633},\\operatorname{NextS}_{633},\\operatorname{NextW}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Boundary}_{633},\\Vdash_{633},\\models_{633},\\mathsf{Val}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{633},\\mathsf{Rule}_{633},\\mathsf{Line}_{633},\\mathsf{Proof}_{633},\\vdash_{633},\\mathsf{Thm}_{633}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LTLf}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{633}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{633},\\operatorname{FV}_{633},\\operatorname{BV}_{633},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{633},\\widehat\\sigma_{633},\\equiv_{\\alpha,633},\n\\mathsf{FTr